        Code statements:
        <text1>
        <text2>
        ...
        <textN>

Code statements:
```c
dma_filter_fn filter;
filter = NULL;
if (spdif_pdata) {
	spdif_stereo_out.filter_data = spdif_pdata->dma_playback;
	filter = spdif_pdata->dma_filter;
}
```

